    "title": "Get your Obama Presidential Center Ventra card before Friday's opening and other stuff to know - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Robin Sluzas ,\n4 hours ago Ventra Cards are the ticket to riding Chicago’s transit system — and now you can grab a limited-edition Obama Presidential Center card to commemorate the center’s opening this Friday, June 19. The special-edition card is available exclusively online at ventrachicago.com, priced at $5 above the standard card... Read full article\n2",
